the obligation that the charity must file its annual return obliges a party to file the annual return by day a due day D as its first obligation is met on day a day N if
    the party does file the annual return on day N
    and the obligation that the charity must file its annual return obliges the party to file the annual return by day D as its first obligation starts on day a day M
    and M < N
    and N <= D.

